<title>NETHERLANDS: DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of Feb 24.</title>
<headline>DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of Feb 24.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau</p>
<p>of Statistics (CBS) said it planned to publish the following key</p>
<p>Dutch economic indicators next week.</p>
<p>GMT----date--indicator------------------period---previous</p>
<p> 0830  24/02  Business confidence index  Jan	0.11</p>
<p> 0830  25/02  Consumer confidence index  Feb	18</p>
<p> 0830  27/02  GDP				Q4	 +3.0 pct y/y</p>
<p> 0830  27/02  Consumer spending	    Q4	 +3.2 pct y/y</p>
<p> 0830  28/02  Retail sales		   Q4 96    ---</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
